    deficitFriction: 'When Wood is deficient, the capacity for strategic expansion collapses inward. You generate vision without propulsion — ideas that never cross the execution threshold. The business cost is measurable: missed market timing, delayed product launches, and the slow erosion of team confidence as momentum perpetually stalls. Wood is the element of upward movement. Without it, you stay in the planning room while the market moves on.',
    year2026: 'The Bing Wu (Fire Horse) year creates Fire-over-Wood dynamics. Fire consumes Wood — external pressures will accelerate faster than your natural rhythm. Key watch period: Summer. Mitigation: lean into Metal-aligned precision tools, structured workflows, and analytical frameworks.',
