    deficitFriction: 'A depleted Fire element creates a blind spot in personal radiance and professional magnetism. You may produce work of extraordinary quality, yet remain invisible in rooms where your contributions should shine. In leadership contexts, this manifests as an inability to command attention or inspire follow-through. The cost is not just missed recognition — it is the slow erosion of professional leverage. Without Fire, competence is a locked room with no windows.',
    year2026: 'Bing Wu doubles your natal Fire deficiency with celestial Fire intensity — maximum exposure. You will be pushed into visibility whether ready or not. Risk: burnout. Opportunity: this forced radiance is your fastest path to building the presence you lack. Key watch: June through October.',
    mediums: 'Crystalline Lattices: Citrine, Red Jasper, Sunstone | Direction: True South — amber lighting | Materials: Warm-toned metal, cinnamon diffusers, candle clusters'
