    mirror: 'Your nervous system stays in sympathetic overdrive, treating every deadline as a survival event. Stability is not boring — it is the structural prerequisite for exponential growth.',
    shift: 'Anchor your schedule with non-negotiable recovery blocks. Install physical grounding practices: barefoot work intervals, weighted rest periods, fixed meal rhythms.',
    deficitFriction: 'An Earth deficiency creates a boom-bust operating rhythm that erodes long-term trust — both from others and from yourself. Intense productive surges followed by prolonged collapse become the pattern. The underlying mechanics are elemental: Earth provides the centering gravitational force that sustains consistent output. Without it, every cycle begins with enthusiasm and ends in depletion. You are not unreliable — you are structurally ungrounded.',
    year2026: 'Bing Wu Fire produces Earth in the generative cycle — structurally favorable. The Fire supply will feed your deficient Earth, creating unusual stability. However, Fire Horse delivers growth through disruption. Key watch: Lunar July. Mitigation: Water-element rest, introspection, fluid scheduling.',
