  <!-- FIVE ELEMENTS FRAMEWORK -->
  <section class="elements-section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 class="elements-title">Free Five Elements Birth Chart &amp; Bazi Calculator</h2>
      <p class="elements-subtitle">Your Wu Xing (five elements) personality test based on authentic Chinese astrology. Discover your Wood, Fire, Earth, Metal &amp; Water balance — the same framework used by ancient strategists, now calibrated for modern founders and creators.</p>
      <div class="elements-grid">
        <div class="element-card">
          <span class="element-tag" style="border-color:rgba(0,168,107,0.3);color:rgba(0,168,107,0.7)">WOOD</span>
          <svg class="element-icon" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22V8"/><path d="M12 8c0-3-2-5-2-5s2 1 4 3 3 4 3 6"/></svg>
          <h3>Growth &amp; Vision Expansion</h3>
          <p>Wood governs how you scale — from a solo practice to a global operation. Strong Wood energy signals unstoppable momentum; deficiency means repeated friction in launching new initiatives.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="element-card">
          <span class="element-tag" style="border-color:rgba(255,77,77,0.3);color:rgba(255,77,77,0.7)">FIRE</span>
          <svg class="element-icon" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8.5 14.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 11 12c0-1.38-.5-2-1-3-1.072-2.143-.224-4.054 2-6 .5 2.5 2 4.9 4 6.5 2 1.6 3 3.5 3 5.5a7 7 0 1 1-14 0c0-1.153.433-2.294 1-3a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 2.5 2.5z"/></svg>
          <h3>Visibility &amp; Magnetic Presence</h3>
          <p>Fire controls how the world sees you. It drives public speaking, thought leadership, and social proof. A balanced Fire profile attracts opportunities without chasing them.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="element-card">
          <span class="element-tag" style="border-color:rgba(212,175,55,0.3);color:rgba(212,175,55,0.7)">EARTH</span>
          <svg class="element-icon" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M2 12h20"/><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"/></svg>
          <h3>Stability &amp; Grounded Execution</h3>
          <p>Earth is your operational spine — the ability to maintain consistency under volatility. Weak Earth leads to burnout cycles; strong Earth builds institutions that outlast their founder.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="element-card">
          <span class="element-tag" style="border-color:rgba(192,192,192,0.3);color:rgba(192,192,192,0.7)">METAL</span>
          <svg class="element-icon" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="14.5 17.5 3 6 3 3 6 3 17.5 14.5"/><line x1="13" y1="19" x2="19" y2="13"/><line x1="16" y1="16" x2="20" y2="20"/><line x1="19" y1="21" x2="21" y2="19"/></svg>
          <h3>Execution &amp; Precision</h3>
          <p>Metal governs structure, deadlines, and delivery quality. High Metal profiles are natural operators who turn visions into systems. Too little Metal can manifest as analysis paralysis.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="element-card">
          <span class="element-tag" style="border-color:rgba(0,150,255,0.3);color:rgba(0,150,255,0.7)">WATER</span>
          <svg class="element-icon" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 12c2.5-3 5.5-3 8 0s5.5 3 8 0 5.5-3 8 0"/><path d="M2 18c2.5-3 5.5-3 8 0s5.5 3 8 0 5.5-3 8 0"/></svg>
          <h3>Agility &amp; Strategic Timing</h3>
          <p>Water determines your ability to read market cycles and pivot intelligently. It is the element of wealth flow and adaptive intelligence — knowing when to act and when to wait.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

